{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "821dfd5f-6d0c-8718-a1ad-9ce2c7be64a2",
  "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:47:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sal Pellegrino",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:44:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:45:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. [pause] Yeah, I know it's Saturday and City Hall's closed, that's why I'm on this line. I'm calling about water in my yard. Two-forty Memorial Boulevard, over by Easton's Beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:45:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, two-forty Memorial Boulevard. And this is from the storm, the one that came in Friday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:45:18-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the nor'easter. Came in Friday, wrapped up today. [pause] The water comes right down the hill from the next street over and runs straight into my yard. Straight in. It's like a creek out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:45:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's coming off the street above you and running down onto your property."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:45:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Nothing stops it, nothing takes it. It just comes down the hill and sits in my yard. And this isn't new. My neighbor says it happens every big rain. Every one. So it's not like anybody didn't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:45:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, that's a headache. Is the water up near the house, or is it mostly the yard right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:45:58-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the yard right now. It's close to the foundation though. [pause] Hang on, my watch is buzzing. Okay, that's my step goal, I've been out there walking the edge of the yard all morning. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:46:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're fine. So the yard, close to the foundation, and it's the runoff from the next street. Do you know if there's a drain up there, or is it just the slope?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:46:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't know. I just know where it ends up. [sigh] Look, I'd like somebody to come look at it. Somebody from the city. It keeps happening and nobody does anything about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:46:35-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I'm writing this up for the crews as a drainage complaint at two-forty Memorial Boulevard, water running off the hill from the neighboring street into your yard. They're stretched thin right after a storm, but it'll be on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:46:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can somebody call me back when it's done? Or when somebody's been out. I don't want to just wonder."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:46:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:47:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0166. It's the landline, so if I don't pick up, just leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:47:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-six. I'll note that they should call you once it's handled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:47:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:47:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Pellegrino. Take care."
    }
  ],
